TI  - Decoding the metabolic synergy and extracellular electron transfer bottleneck in manganese-driven nitrogen removal: Mechanisms underlying the dominance of comammox bacteria.
AU  - Zhu, Xurui
AU  - Zhang, Xiaonong
AU  - Zhang, Xingxing
AU  - Al-Dhabi, Naif Abdullah
AU  - Tang, Wangwang
AU  - Wu, Peng
